 # lakeside-desk
 
+Documentation version: 0.2.0 (2026-10-25)
+
 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Rental service
+
+`createRentalService()` creates an isolated in-memory rental service. Add a board or sail with an id and
+integer daily price in euro cents, then call `quote` or `book` with UTC ISO-8601 midnight timestamps. Rental
+periods are half-open: `start` is included and `end` is the midnight after the final rental day. A booking
+cannot overlap another booking for the same item.
+
+Bookings use deterministic sequential ids. Cancellation is intentionally not available yet; its refund
+policy will be added with cancellation support.
